<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-DORTMUND REJECT MONACO BID FOR REUTER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DORTMUND REJECT MONACO BID FOR REUTER.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borussia Dortmund have rejected an offer for captain Stefan Reuter from French league champions Monaco, German media reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The Bild newspaper said Monaco had contacted Dortmund on Thursday and wanted to do a deal immediately.</p>
<p>&quot;The conversation lasted five minutes and then they had their rejection,&quot; Dortmund general manager Michael Meier was reported as saying.</p>
</text>
